      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "I'm going to order a thyroid blood test, for annual review. Keep taking the tablet on an empty stomach, apart from coffee. Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. Come back or go to emergency straight away if you notice palpitations or weight change.",
